cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use lucem in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "lucem: GPU-accelerated image analysis for biology"
abstract: >-
  A computer-vision workstation for researchers, written in Rust: image operations written once in
  CubeCL and run on any GPU or the CPU, multiscale OME-Zarr viewing, annotation, measurement and
  reproducible pipelines of operators.
authors:
  - given-names: Jesus
    family-names: Penaloza Aponte
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5903-2291"
repository-code: "https://github.com/neuro-kitchen/lucem"
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - image analysis
  - microscopy
  - histology
  - OME-Zarr
  - GPU
  - CubeCL
  - Rust
